      "source": "BIGHIT MUSIC / CORTIS Official",
      "title": "CORTIS Team Up With Juicy J On New Single 'MOTION'!",
      "excerpt": "Young creator crew era continues. New single and GreenGreen tracks inside.",
      "quote": "COER, keep up with this motion!",
      "image": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/h7ITAdTxdxM/maxresdefault.jpg",
      "body": [
        "CORTIS have officially continued their GreenGreen era with the new single 'MOTION (feat. Juicy J)', with concept films dropping across official channels.",
        "BIGHIT MUSIC confirms new music written and produced together by all five members, including titles 'RedRed', 'TNT', 'What You Want' and 'GO!'.",
        "The new era arrives as COER celebrates the group's debut EP Color Outside the Lines and rapid global rise.",
        "Pre-save links are open now on all major streaming platforms."
      ]
    }
